From c8dbae2d7aa82bb154d0f087eca66a9aba725d91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent-speed <dev@agent-speed.local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:56:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Command Code quota monitoring

Read Command Code credentials without writing them: a key saved from Subscription Settings on the local app or an enabled SSH host wins, then COMMAND_CODE_API_KEY, then ~/.commandcode/auth.json. Query the /alpha whoami, credits and subscriptions routes on Windows, macOS and the Linux collector. Map remaining monthly, weekly and 5-hour allowances; keep purchased/free credits as a separate balance. Remote management uses the commandcode_credentials control with a 0600 revisioned store; local keys use Keychain or current-user DPAPI.

Adapted from Codenotch (MIT, commit 835550a342871779135b6484d6899161c5222f7c); license notices updated. Provider id is commandcode and remote sources keep credentials on the collector host.
